---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
description: "Swing, salsa, country nights, and black-tie balls for young adults in DC, Maryland, and Virginia. Over 4,000 members. Find the next night out."
---
{%- set nxt = collections.upcoming[0] %}
<section class="hero on-dark">
  <img class="bg" src="/images/gallery/17.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1667" fetchpriority="high">
  <video class="bg" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/images/gallery/17.jpg" aria-hidden="true"><source src="/video/hero.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h1>The DMV's biggest nights out for <em>young professionals.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Salsa on the vineyard lawn at The Winery at Bull Run. Two-step under the string lights at Whiffletree Farm. Black tie and a big band at Hotel Heron. 600 people a night, and every one of them came to meet someone.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn" href="/events/">Get tickets</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/about/">Who we are</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% if nxt %}
    <a class="next" href="{{ nxt.url }}">
      <img src="{{ nxt.data.image }}" alt="" width="1500" height="750">
      <div class="body">
        <p class="kicker">Next up · {{ nxt | iso | longDate }}</p>
        <h2>{{ nxt.data.title }}</h2>
        <p class="meta">{{ nxt.data.venue }} · {{ nxt.data.time }}{% if nxt.data.end %} to {{ nxt.data.end }}{% endif %}</p>
        <span class="btn">Get tickets</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band navy on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>On the calendar</h2><a href="/events/">All events</a></div>
    <ul class="events">
    {%- for e in collections.upcoming %}
      <li><a href="{{ e.url }}">
        <span class="date">{{ e | iso | shortDate }}<small>{{ e | iso | weekday }} · {{ e.data.time }}</small></span>
        <span><h3>{{ e.data.title }}</h3><p class="venue">{{ e.data.venue }}</p></span>
        <img class="thumb" src="{{ e.data.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="1500" height="750">
      </a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">These sell out. New dates drop on <a href="{{ site.instagram }}" style="color:var(--amber)">Instagram</a> first. <a href="#signup" style="color:var(--amber)">Join the list</a> to get them by email.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>Four nights we run back all year</h2></div>
    <div class="series">
      <article><img src="/images/gallery/03.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div class="txt"><h3>Sangria y Salsa</h3><p>The DMV's largest Latin dance series. 600+ people, salsa and bachata, live Latin music, sangria, and the whole vineyard at The Winery at Bull Run.</p></div></article>
      <article><img src="/images/gallery/12.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div class="txt"><h3>All-American Country Nights</h3><p>Country swing, two-step, line dancing, BBQ, and wine, in the barn at Whiffletree Farm in Warrenton or on the grounds at Bull Run. A 45-minute lesson opens every night, so nobody stands at the wall.</p></div></article>
      <article><img src="/images/gallery/13.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div class="txt"><h3>Formal galas</h3><p>Black tie, a live big band, and a few hundred people who dressed for it. The Crooner Christmas Ball at Hotel Heron, St. Joseph's Ball at Catholic University, and The Grape Gatsby at Old Farm Winery.</p></div></article>
      <article><img src="/images/gallery/23.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div class="txt"><h3>Soirees and summer nights</h3><p>Strawberries on the lawn at President Lincoln's Cottage, a rooftop in Old Town, disco on the docks of Columbia Island Marina.</p></div></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band navy on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>This is what Whiffletree Farm looks like at 9 pm</h2><a href="/about/#watch">More videos</a></div>
    <video class="feature" controls preload="none" poster="/video/swing.jpg" width="1280" height="720"><source src="/video/swing.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <p style="margin-top:.8rem;font-size:.95rem">Swing into Spring at Whiffletree Farm, April 2025. Video by Chris Byrne and Saint Clair Media.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band paper">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <img src="/images/gallery/09.jpg" alt="Hundreds of guests at a DSC ball" loading="lazy" width="2500" height="1668">
    <div>
      <h2>Started for people who moved here and didn't know anyone yet.</h2>
      <p class="lede">DC Social Collective launched in 2021, when the pandemic had emptied out the young adult scene. Five years on it is the largest young adult community in the DMV, 4,000 members strong, and its nights sell out weeks ahead.</p>
      <p>Most of the room is in their twenties and early thirties. You don't need a date and you don't need to be Catholic, though that is where our roots are. You come, you take the lesson, and you leave knowing people.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/about/">Read our story</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band navy on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>From the dance floor</h2><a href="/gallery/">All photos</a></div>
    <div class="mosaic">
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/gallery/04.jpg" alt="A packed dance floor at The Winery at Bull Run" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/gallery/07.jpg" alt="Guests in 1920s dress" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/gallery/21.jpg" alt="Friends at a ball" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/gallery/14.jpg" alt="A dance under stage fog" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/gallery/11.jpg" alt="Country dancing" loading="lazy"></a>
    </div>
    <blockquote class="quote" style="margin-top:4rem">“I'm not exactly confident in social situations, but thanks to you guys I was able to expand my comfort zone and meet some nice people.”<cite>A member, in the DSC Facebook group</cite></blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="signup">
  <div class="wrap signup">
    <div>
      <h2>Get the date before it sells out.</h2>
      <p>One email when a night is announced, one when early bird pricing is about to end. That's it.</p>
    </div>
    <form action="https://formsubmit.co/{{ site.email }}" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New mailing list signup from the website">
      <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ site.url }}/thanks/">
      <input type="text" name="first" placeholder="First name" required aria-label="First name">
      <input type="text" name="last" placeholder="Last name" aria-label="Last name">
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email address" required aria-label="Email address">
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Sign me up</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band paper">
  <div class="wrap sponsors">
    <img src="/images/redline.png" alt="Red Line Rentals" loading="lazy">
    <div class="txt"><p><strong>Our nights are powered by Red Line Rentals</strong>, live sound and lighting for the DMV.</p><p><a href="/get-involved/#sponsor">Sponsor an event</a> and put your name in front of a few hundred young professionals at a time.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
